，这盘布局是否成功就看黑方这一苹八路过河包有没有发挥威力。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":6,"anchor_node_id":"0:6","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment7:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment7","raw_text":"红方兵三进一是有效化解黑方过河包的威力。","text":"红方兵三进一是有效化解黑方过河包的威力。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":7,"anchor_node_id":"0:7","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment11:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment11","raw_text":"红方进三路兵，当然是为了三路马跃马盘河。","text":"红方进三路兵，当然是为了三路马跃马盘河。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":11,"anchor_node_id":"0:11","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment12:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment12","raw_text":"黑方平包射兵是过河包接下来当然之手段。","text":"黑方平包射兵是过河包接下来当然之手段。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":12,"anchor_node_id":"0:12","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment13:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment13","raw_text":"红方进车兑车当然。","text":"红方进车兑车当然。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":13,"anchor_node_id":"0:13","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment15:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment15","raw_text":"兑车之後，红方这苹四路盘河马抢黑方的中路卒是布局的要点。","text":"兑车之後，红方这苹四路盘河马抢黑方的中路卒是布局的要点。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":15,"anchor_node_id":"0:15","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment16:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment16","raw_text":"黑方只能够飞象不能进马去马，进马去马之後红方变成空头炮。","text":"黑方只能够飞象不能进马去马，进马去马之後红方变成空头炮。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":16,"anchor_node_id":"0:16","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment17","raw_text":"红方退马去卒并兼踩黑方的二路包。","text":"红方退马去卒并兼踩黑方的二路包。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"0:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment18","raw_text":"黑方避包并明一路车当然。","text":"黑方避包并明一路车当然。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"0:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment19","raw_text":"红方先车九平八牵制黑方的一路车平二。","text":"红方先车九平八牵制黑方的一路车平二。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"0:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment20","raw_text":"黑方支士，次一著可以飞象去马。","text":"黑方支士，次一著可以飞象去马。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"0:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment21:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment21","raw_text":"红方退马踩包当然。","text":"红方退马踩包当然。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":21,"anchor_node_id":"0:21","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment22","raw_text":"黑方进马保包。","text":"黑方进马保包。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"0:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment23:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment23","raw_text":"这一步棋红方不能进炮抓马，因为黑方有马二进四的好棋，所以红方退马去包。","text":"这一步棋红方不能进炮抓马，因为黑方有马二进四的好棋，所以红方退马去包。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":23,"anchor_node_id":"0:23","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment25","raw_text":"兑子之後红方有沉底炮攻势，黑方的五路象马上受威胁，局面到此红方优势。","text":"兑子之後红方有沉底炮攻势，黑方的五路象马上受威胁，局面到此红方优势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"0:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment27:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment27","raw_text":"虽然红方有进马去包的棋。但进马去包之後，红方战场宽阔，黑方别别扭扭，局势对红方绝对有利。","text":"虽然红方有进马去包的棋。但进马去包之後，红方战场宽阔，黑方别别扭扭，局势对红方绝对有利。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":27,"anchor_node_id":"0:27","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_8:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_8","raw_text":"我们再回头过来看，当这个局面，红方进三路兵时。黑方反架当头包而不下屏风马也是常用的一步棋。","text":"我们再回头过来看，当这个局面，红方进三路兵时。黑方反架当头包而不下屏风马也是常用的一步棋。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":8,"anchor_node_id":"1:8","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_11:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_11","raw_text":"红方还是跳出三路马威胁黑方的八路包。","text":"红方还是跳出三路马威胁黑方的八路包。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":11,"anchor_node_id":"1:11","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_12:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_12","raw_text":"在这边黑方如果进包打马。","text":"在这边黑方如果进包打马。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":12,"anchor_node_id":"1:12","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_13:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_13","raw_text":"红方也进马踩马。","text":"红方也进马踩马。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":13,"anchor_node_id":"1:13","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_14:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_14","raw_text":"黑方平包射马就产生一连串的兑子。","text":"黑方平包射马就产生一连串的兑子。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":14,"anchor_node_id":"1:14","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_17","raw_text":"在这个局面红方不进马去马。而下出马六进八是一个魄力，也是一种弃子的走法，因为在目前的兵力上的红方少掉一颗子。","text":"在这个局面红方不进马去马。而下出马六进八是一个魄力，也是一种弃子的走法，因为在目前的兵力上的红方少掉一颗子。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"1:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_18","raw_text":"黑方进包取中兵。","text":"黑方进包取中兵。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"1:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_19","raw_text":"这一步棋红方不支士而平炮是什麽原因呢？其目的就是要保留九路横车的威力。","text":"这一步棋红方不支士而平炮是什麽原因呢？其目的就是要保留九路横车的威力。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"1:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_20","raw_text":"黑方上老将不得已，因为如果支士的话，红方卧槽马叫将可以抽车。","text":"黑方上老将不得已，因为如果支士的话，红方卧槽马叫将可以抽车。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"1:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_21:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_21","raw_text":"红方进九路横车当然，之所以能够进九路横车，就是拜前著红方的炮五平六。","text":"红方进九路横车当然，之所以能够进九路横车，就是拜前著红方的炮五平六。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":21,"anchor_node_id":"1:21","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_22","raw_text":"黑方在乎这一苹九路横车的威力，所以先包五平六防守。","text":"黑方在乎这一苹九路横车的威力，所以先包五平六防守。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"1:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_23:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_23","raw_text":"因为红方有平车抓马再进车叫将的棋，所以刚刚黑方就要包五平六防守，它的道理就是在这里。","text":"因为红方有平车抓马再进车叫将的棋，所以刚刚黑方就要包五平六防守，它的道理就是在这里。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":23,"anchor_node_id":"1:23","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_26:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_26","raw_text":"当黑方跃马屯边时，红方进车叫将，逼黑方退包挡车。","text":"当黑方跃马屯边时，红方进车叫将，逼黑方退包挡车。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":26,"anchor_node_id":"1:26","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_27:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_27","raw_text":"红方再平五路炮叫将。","text":"红方再平五路炮叫将。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":27,"anchor_node_id":"1:27","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_28","raw_text":"黑方只好飞象。","text":"黑方只好飞象。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"1:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_29:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_29","raw_text":"红方跳马踩车。","text":"红方跳马踩车。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":29,"anchor_node_id":"1:29","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_30:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_30","raw_text":"黑方平车抓炮当然，否则红方进炮叫将成马後炮杀。","text":"黑方平车抓炮当然，否则红方进炮叫将成马後炮杀。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":30,"anchor_node_id":"1:30","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_31:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_31","raw_text":"红方退马去象，次一著退马叫将就可以将死了。局面到此红方占绝对的优势，黑方败定。||||这盘棋我们学到破解黑方在第三步棋就进包封车的妙棋。兵三进一为玩家值得谨记的要著。本布局就介绍到这边，谢谢！","text":"红方退马去象，次一著退马叫将就可以将死了。局面到此红方占绝对的优势，黑方败定。\n\n这盘棋我们学到破解黑方在第三步棋就进包封车的妙棋。兵三进一为玩家值得谨记的要著。本布局就介绍到这边，谢谢！","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":31,"anchor_node_id":"1:31","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["2.当头炮进三兵右马盘河攻屏风马左炮封车局"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第3节 进三兵攻击篇 第二章"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":40,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":2,"structured_branches":1,"line_statuses":{"legal":2},"source_move_records":51,"legal_move_records":51,"annotations":34,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":34}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-65","category_id":"65","title":"第二章 当头炮攻屏风马 第3节 进三兵攻击 2.当头炮进三兵右马盘河攻屏风马左炮封车局","catalogue_order":53,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-65-3.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-65"]}}
